# CONSULTAPP — COMPLETE WEBSITE VISUAL REDESIGN & UI/UX REFINEMENT

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Redesign the existing ConsultAPP public-facing website into a polished, distinctive, modern and production-quality digital experience.

This is a **visual redesign and UX refinement of the existing project**, not a new project.

Inspect the existing codebase, current pages, routing, components, design tokens, responsive layouts, interactions and available assets before making any changes.

Understand how the current website works before modifying its appearance.

Your task is to significantly improve the visual quality, brand identity, information hierarchy, component consistency, typography, imagery, interaction design and animation system across all existing public-facing pages.

The current interface does not meet the intended visual quality. Do not merely change the primary colour and leave the existing layout, generic cards, weak typography, repetitive sections or uninspired visual composition untouched.

Approach this as an experienced senior product designer and frontend engineer conducting a comprehensive design refresh.

### The desired outcome

ConsultAPP should feel like a real, thoughtfully designed expertise marketplace with a clear brand identity, excellent usability, polished interactions and a consistent visual language.

The interface should be:

- Modern and structured
- Bold without being visually noisy
- Premium without feeling inaccessible
- Human without looking casual or childish
- Professional without feeling corporate and sterile
- Minimal without looking empty or unfinished
- Interactive without excessive animation
- Distinctive without sacrificing usability

The result must look intentional and cohesive rather than like a generic AI-generated SaaS template.

