- Preserve all interactive functionality.

Ensure:

- Keyboard navigation.
- Visible focus states.
- Accessible labels.
- Semantic headings.
- Sufficient contrast.
- Accessible dialogs.
- Accessible mobile menus.
- Screen-reader-friendly controls.

Do not make the user wait for an animation before interacting with the page.

